WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.761 --> 00:00:09.277
Why can Tesla finish a car every thirty seconds, and BYD one every seven, while the West waits years for the missiles that arm its Patriot batteries?

2
00:00:09.357 --> 00:00:12.047
Aegis Stratos exists because of the answer.

3
00:00:12.593 --> 00:00:19.346
In 2025, Lockheed Martin delivered 620 PAC-3 interceptors, the missiles Patriot fires.

4
00:00:19.527 --> 00:00:21.554
One every fourteen hours.

5
00:00:21.608 --> 00:00:26.367
In that same year, Tesla's Shanghai plant shipped about fourteen hundred cars for each one.

6
00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:30.159
Even tripling Patriot missile production will take until 2030.

7
00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:34.389
In a war, demand surges overnight, and the threat changes in weeks.

8
00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:37.362
A line like that cannot surge, and it cannot pivot.

9
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:38.160
Not today.

10
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.308
Aegis Stratos is built to do both.

11
00:00:40.854 --> 00:00:42.615
Is the missile harder to build?

12
00:00:42.691 --> 00:00:43.375
Partly.

13
00:00:43.399 --> 00:00:45.873
But the bigger problem is the system around it.

14
00:00:45.953 --> 00:00:46.887
Take America.

15
00:00:46.941 --> 00:00:49.644
From contract to first unit, about two years.

16
00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:54.016
From the start of a major US programme to its first capability, about twelve.

17
00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:56.556
And protection that arrives late protects no one.

18
00:00:57.181 --> 00:00:59.237
That is traditional defence.

19
00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.751
The people are not slow; the model is.

20
00:01:01.823 --> 00:01:07.062
Wait for a requirement, win a contract, build to the specification, deliver, stop.

21
00:01:07.342 --> 00:01:11.294
Each programme is a line with an end, and much of the learning ends with it.

22
00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:16.635
Aegis Stratos is built as a product company, on the model Apple and Tesla proved.

23
00:01:16.664 --> 00:01:21.424
We discover, we innovate, we learn from the data, and we innovate again.

24
00:01:21.504 --> 00:01:26.615
That iteration is how Aegis Stratos is built to stay ahead of the market and ahead of the threat.

25
00:01:26.695 --> 00:01:27.598
Not a line.

26
00:01:27.638 --> 00:01:28.571
A loop.

27
00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:37.718
And Tesla's real advantage is physical AI: AI that helps design, build, test and ship, from software, to components, to final assembly.

28
00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:42.052
Aegis Stratos is built to operate the same way, as one of the first in defence.

29
00:01:42.659 --> 00:01:44.285
And a loop compounds.

30
00:01:44.352 --> 00:01:51.304
Every lap makes the next one faster, so each release is built to beat the last, with no new contract and no new programme.

31
00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.032
What turns the loop is AI.

32
00:01:54.112 --> 00:01:57.929
Fewer than one in three companies have scaled AI across the business.

33
00:01:58.009 --> 00:02:00.289
Aegis Stratos is built around it.

34
00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:03.796
AI runs through our design, build, sales and support.

35
00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:08.970
And it is inside the product: machines that sense, decide and act in the real world.

36
00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:09.957
Physical AI.

37
00:02:10.503 --> 00:02:14.751
Put the two together and how Aegis Stratos builds becomes the advantage.

38
00:02:14.984 --> 00:02:18.217
A traditional manufacturer is locked to its production line.

39
00:02:18.257 --> 00:02:23.030
Aegis Stratos is designed to pivot in weeks, into an entirely new product line.

40
00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:27.453
Our first platform is already in the air, and our own agentic models are in development.

41
00:02:27.493 --> 00:02:31.359
Drones first, humanoid robots in time, all on the same loop.

42
00:02:31.906 --> 00:02:34.407
Defence can move at the speed of the threat.

43
00:02:34.545 --> 00:02:36.905
Aegis Stratos is built to prove it.

44
00:02:36.945 --> 00:02:38.106
AI for peace.

45
00:02:38.146 --> 00:02:39.193
Built for protection.
